& [CanonicalRecord: FSC2FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for FSC2 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 6a949014-c278-4073-b2e4-4c0eb1f9ee5d
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 9ff9386d-b228-4ed7-8fa1-e48612e41727
  + [exploded_uuid] is b95a873a-0251-4fc0-9a4d-73815381a77a
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 8108c94b-16ab-457e-ac61-1c6f4fddd32a
  + [authority_scope] is FSC2 slice order, slice readiness, slice gates, model routing, expected outputs, and verification oracles
  + [implementation_scope] is final slice planning authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC1_Foundation_Contract_Pack.v1.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/FSC2_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current FSC2 slice surface
  = must: execute FSC2-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: keep FSC3 through FSC5 work gated until FSC2-S07 accepts the planning coordination pack
  - never: treat FSC2 slice records as implementation proof

& [CanonicalFSC2SliceSet] is the final FSC2 slice sequence
  + [slice] is FSC2-S01 imported boundary and invariant map
  + [slice] is FSC2-S02 planning readiness operator contract
  + [slice] is FSC2-S03 work packet generation contract
  + [slice] is FSC2-S04 coordination claim and rendezvous contracts
  + [slice] is FSC2-S05 completion review delta gate contract
  + [slice] is FSC2-S06 planning coordination fixture plan
  + [slice] is FSC2-S07 FSC2 completion review and activation packet

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes FSC2
  = must: mark downstream slices stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalFSC2ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for FSC2
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC2-S01
  + [gated_slice] is FSC2-S02 until FSC2-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC2-S03 until FSC2-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC2-S04 until FSC2-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC2-S05 until FSC2-S02, FSC2-S03, and FSC2-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC2-S06 until FSC2-S05 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC2-S07 until FSC2-S06 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is FSC2 planning coordination pack accepted after FSC2-S07

  = must: expose only FSC2-S01 as ready right now
  = must: keep all later slices gated inside FSC2

& [CanonicalFSC2ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [FSC2-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC2-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC2-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC2-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC2-S05] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC2-S06] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after FSC2-S01 through FSC2-S05 are accepted
  + [FSC2-S07] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep readiness semantics, work-packet authority, coordination claim boundaries, and completion-review delta gates under deeper reasoning
  = should: route fixture drafting to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after FSC2 contracts stabilize

